'''Kyren fish (6)''' is a [[food]] item made by using [[raw kyren fish (6)]] on a [[fire]] within the [[Chambers of Xeric]]. Eating a kyren fish heals the player for 23 [[hitpoints]].

Cooking kyren fish requires a [[Cooking]] level of 90, and yields 28 Cooking [[experience]] for each successfully cooked fish. Kyren fish stop burning on a fire at a cooking level of 99.

